                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- PROTOTYPE -->

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">

                <div class="design-card">

                    <div class="design-number">
                        03
                    </div>

                    <div class="design-icon">
                        <i class="bi bi-bezier2"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h4>
                        Prototype
                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        Ideas become wireframes and interactive
                        prototypes so flows can be explored
                        before development begins.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


            <!-- VALIDATE -->

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">

                <div class="design-card">

                    <div class="design-number">
                        04
                    </div>

                    <div class="design-icon">
                        <i class="bi bi-check2-circle"></i>
                    </div>

                    <h4>
                        Validate
                    </h4>

                    <p>
                        We test important interactions, collect
                        feedback, refine the experience, and
                        prepare polished designs for development.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>


        </div>

    </div>

</section>


